# React Frontend

This directory contains the React + Vite frontend for ClinicAI Pro SaaS.

## Planned structure

```text
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── App.jsx
│   ├── main.jsx
│   ├── index.css
│   └── components/
├── public/
├── index.html
├── package.json
├── vite.config.js
├── postcss.config.js
├── tailwind.config.js
└── .env.example
```

## Initial frontend goals

- dashboard shell
- authentication UI
- sidebar navigation
- patient and appointment listings
- financial summary widgets
- responsive medical SaaS design

## Suggested routes

- `/login`
- `/dashboard`
- `/patients`
- `/appointments`
- `/billing`
- `/ai-assistant`
- `/settings`

## Design language

- modern healthcare UI
- white and medical blue palette
- accessible contrast ratios
- tables, cards, search, filters, and modals
